{"id":2490310,"sci":"Motacilla cinerea","inatName":"Motacilla cinerea","ar":"ذُعرَةٌ رَمداء","arAlt":["ذعرة رمادية","ذعرة رمداء"],"en":"Gray Wagtail","local":null,"localNote":null,"group":null,"hunting":false,"fam":"Motacillidae","famAr":null,"ord":"Passeriformes","ordAr":"عصفوريات","iucn":"LC","status":"resident","months":[22,44,146,52,10,0,0,57,133,81,44,41],"presence":[0.22,0.35,1,0.34,0.09,0,0,0.7,0.95,0.51,0.37,0.41],"n":630,"inat":13688,"inatN":54905,"ebird":"grywag","summary":"الذُّعَرَة الرمداء أو الرمادية أو الزِّيْطَة أو أم صُفَيْدَة ويسمى أيضا أبوفصادة رمادي (الاسم العلمي: Motacilla cinerea) (بالإنجليزية: Grey Wagtail) هو طائر ينتمي إلى طيور التمرة وأم عجلان (فصيلة: Motacillidae). طائر من القواطع طوله نحو 20 سم. ثوبه إلى الربدة السمراء يعلوه مُوَاجٌ أصفر. عنقه وسقطاه سود. محسراه إلى الرمادي. بطنه إلى السمرة يعلوه مواج كبريتي. يألف المناقع وضفاف الأنهار.","summaryEn":null,"wiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/ذعرة_رمداء","arWiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B0%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%B1%D9%85%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%A1","photos":[{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/849468/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) kellyr115, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC)","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/59571207/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Mark Kilner, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC-SA)","lic":"cc-by-nc-sa"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/1302395/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Mark Kilner, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC-SA)","lic":"cc-by-nc-sa"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/59571206/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Juan Emilio, some rights reserved (CC BY-SA)","lic":"cc-by-sa"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/55744842/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) alexdersu, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC)","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/1302396/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Mark Kilner, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC-SA)","lic":"cc-by-nc-sa"}],"sounds":[{"id":"1134963","file